values ('freckles-finally', null, 'Freckles, finally', $body$I hid my freckles for years under heavy foundation, even to go to the shop. Then a child on the bus told me, very seriously, that I had stars on my nose. A stranger later called them constellations. I let that be true. I do not wear foundation every day any more, and on the days I do, I leave my nose bare.$body$, 'published', true, true, timestamptz '2026-10-01 09:00:00+00' + interval '9 days', timestamptz '2026-10-01 09:00:00+00' + interval '9 days', timestamptz '2026-10-01 09:00:00+00' + interval '9 days')
